        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Idle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing idle game that's all about comfort, tranquility and immersing yourself in the relaxation. No jarring sounds here, just soothing idle gameplay with gentle progression and an aesthetic that is gentle on the eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get relaxed, earn and use your zen to purchase never-before-seen items such as the one and only &quot;Comfy Armchair&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Idle isn't about grinding, it's about presence, reflection and low-pressure fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a mental breather, a creative recharge or just a calming digital space to inhabit? Then Idle Idle is the game for you!</p>",
